  {'type': 'model_attributes_type', 'loc': ('body',), 'msg': 'Input should be a valid dictionary or object to extract fields from', 'input': b'--4acd56b01b32787850854e6b8f50cba9\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name="job_description"\r\n\r\nRole Overview\n\nWe are looking for a skilled AI/ML Engineer to design, build, and improve intelligent systems that solve real business problems. In this role, you will work across data, machine learning, and engineering to develop models, pipelines, and applications that support product and business goals. The ideal candidate has strong technical skills, problem-solving ability, and can work independently in a remote environment.\n\n\n\nKey Responsibilities\n\nDesign, develop, and deploy machine learning and AI solutions.\nBuild and maintain data pipelines, model workflows, and automation systems.\nTrain, evaluate, and optimize machine learning models.\nWork with structured and unstructured data for analysis and model development.\nCollaborate with product, engineering, and data teams to deliver solutions.\nMonitor model performance and improve reliability over time.\nWrite clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.\nSupport experimentation, testing, and technical validation.\n\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications\n\nExperience in AI, machine learning, or related software engineering roles.\nStrong programming skills, preferably in Python.\nGood understanding of machine learning concepts, model evaluation, and data processing.\nExperience working with datasets, APIs, and production systems.\nAbility to troubleshoot, test, and optimize technical solutions.\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills.\nGood communication and teamwork skills.\nAbility to work independently in a remote setup.\n\n\nPreferred Qualifications\n\nExperience with frameworks such as TensorFlow, PyTorch, scikit-learn, or similar.\nFamiliarity with cloud platforms, MLOps, or model deployment workflows.\nKnowledge of data engineering, feature engineering, or experimentation.\nExperience working in Agile or product-driven environments.\nExposure to generative AI, NLP, computer vision, or recommendation systems.\n\n\nWhat We Offer\n\nRemote and flexible work environment.\nOpportunity to work on meaningful AI and ML projects.\nCollaborative and growth-oriented team culture.\nLearning opportunities across modern AI technologies.\n\n\nEqual Opportunity Employer\n\nWe hire based on skills and expertise. All qualified candidates are welcome regardless of background, experience, or prior employment history. Applications are reviewed solely on demonstrated technical ability and qualifications.\r\n--4acd56b01b32787850854e6b8f50cba9\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sujanya resume.pdf"\r\nContent-Type: application/pdf\r\n\r\n%PDF-1.4\r\n%\xa1\xb3\xc5\xd7\r\n1 0 obj\r\n<</Outlines 2 0 R /Pages 4 0 R /Type/Catalog>>\r\nendobj\r\n2 0 obj\r\n<</Count 0/Type/Outlines>>\r\nendobj\r\n3 0 obj\r\n<</Font<</F10 10 0 R /F12 12 0 R /F14 14 0 R /F17 17 0 R /F19 19 0 R /F21 21 0 R /F25 25 0 R /F27 27 0 R /F7 7 0 R >>>>\r\nendobj\r\n4 0 obj\r\n<</Count 2/Kids[ 23 0 R  29 0 R ]/Type/Pages>>\r\nendobj\r\n5 0 obj\r\n<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 8672/Length1 26360>>stream\r\nx\xdab`d```gp``b0\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xffJ\xcf\xa9Lc\x80\x80\x1a\x06\x06\x91\x0f\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xff\xca\xc9ON\x84pEs\x18\x184\n\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xff\xcaHML\x81\xf0m\xef\x00\t3\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xff\xca\x00\n@\xf8v"@B\x05\x00\x00\x00\xff\xff\xca\xc8-\xa9\x80\xf2-\x80\xeas\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xff\xcaM\xac(\x80\xf0\xd3\x96\x00\t\x05\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xffJ\xceM\x84\xf1\x8f\x00\t\x13\x00\x00\x00\x00\xff\xff|X\tX\x15W\x96\xfeoU\xbd\xe7\xd2\x88\x86\xa7<\x01\xd9\x84\xe2\xc9\x80\xa2,\xafP\x1e"\xb8\xe0\xb8D\xf6\x87\x82\xe2.\x02\xee-\x9a\x89\xb8\xa1Qb\xa2\xb8\xb6\x1a%\x9b\xa3v\xe2\x17IbO\xb7\x8e\x1a\xfd\x9cV;\xea$N\xe2d\x12\x93V\xd4\x8c\x9a8\x9aL\x9cn[_]\xe7\xdc\xaa\xb7\xa0\xdf|\xe3\x95\xaaWU\xb7\xce\xf2\x9fs\xfe{nA\x06\x9e\xde\xb3\xac\xb34!\x19\x